---
description: Keep guesses out of the discrepancy list unless QA later accepts them
alwaysApply: true
---

# Guesses are not discrepancies

If a remark is not a gap between a requirement and observed behavior, write it separately as a guess and mark that it is not based on the requirements. Do not include it in the discrepancy list. It becomes a defect only if QA decides so after discussion.
